# NOTE: `docs/` and root `*.md` are intentionally NOT excluded from the build
# context. The builder generates the deployed-code knowledge bundle (AID-3,
# #2372) with `pnpm run diagnostics:bundle`, which reads the allowlisted docs and
# schema. They are consumed only in the throwaway builder stage — the runtime
# image still excludes raw docs, copying only the curated
# .artifacts/diagnostics/knowledge-bundle.json to the runner.
